---
description: Where the stage specifications live and how to follow them
globs: skills/**/SKILL.md
alwaysApply: false
---
Each `skills/<name>/SKILL.md` is the spec for one stage (purpose, inputs, outputs, procedure, quality gates, prompts, failure modes, extending).
When asked to work on a stage, open its SKILL.md first and follow its procedure and gates. Keep SKILL.md in sync with code changes.
